{"n": 1268, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1268.webp", "text": "65-754\n\nTROUBLESHOOTING BURGLAR ALARM\n\nTest Requirements;\n\nFuse no. 27 in power distributor okay.\n\nBattery charged (voltage at least 11.5 V).\n\nTests made with BMW service tester or BMW digital tester I! and universal adapter with\n26-pin connecting lead.\n\nIf applicable to car, central locks and/or on-board computer okay.\n\nPull off all plugs on burglar alarm control unit and connect the universal adapter on leads,\n\nA. Burglar alarm not working at all\nCars with central locks/unlocking arrest continue with\nCars without central locks continue with\n\nC. Burglar alarm can be turned “on” and “off’, but no alarm\n\nD. Burglar alarm can be turned “on” and “off”, but no ignition\nalarm\n\nE. Indicator lamp not on, but burglar alarm Tt working\n\nNote for Tests 111 and IV:\n\nPlug A (4-pin flat male plug, 2 bevelled edges) is located right rear on the burglar\nalarm control unit.", "words": [["65-754", 0.4813, 0.0298, 0.5593, 0.0557], ["TROUBLESHOOTING", 0.2655, 0.0696, 0.3779, 0.0822], ["BURGLAR", 0.382, 0.0696, 0.4367, 0.0816], ["ALARM", 0.4402, 0.0696, 0.4818, 0.0809], ["Test", 0.266, 0.1353, 0.2862, 0.1459], ["Requirements;", 0.2903, 0.1353, 0.3607, 0.1485], ["Fuse", 0.2665, 0.1512, 0.2888, 0.1625], ["no.", 0.2918, 0.1538, 0.307, 0.1618], ["27", 0.3105, 0.1505, 0.3227, 0.1618], ["in", 0.3267, 0.1512, 0.3359, 0.1618], ["power", 0.3389, 0.1532, 0.3688, 0.1645], ["distributor", 0.3718, 0.1505, 0.423, 0.1618], ["okay.", 0.426, 0.1512, 0.4524, 0.1638], ["Battery", 0.2639, 0.1638, 0.3004, 0.185], ["charged", 0.3055, 0.1638, 0.3409, 0.185], ["(voltage", 0.3465, 0.1671, 0.3961, 0.1804], ["at", 0.3865, 0.1638, 0.3951, 0.185], ["least", 0.3997, 0.1671, 0.421, 0.1784], ["11.5", 0.426, 0.1638, 0.4453, 0.185], ["V).", 0.4504, 0.1664, 0.4645, 0.1784], ["Tests", 0.266, 0.183, 0.2908, 0.195], ["made", 0.2938, 0.1837, 0.3202, 0.1943], ["with", 0.3232, 0.183, 0.345, 0.1943], ["BMW", 0.348, 0.183, 0.3739, 0.1943